# Normalize all text files to LF in both the repository and the working
# tree, regardless of a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without
# this, Windows checkouts can silently convert LF to CRLF, which breaks
# tests that do exact substring matching against migration/source file
# content (e.g. supabase/migrations/*.migration.test.ts).
* text=auto eol=lf
